intro=a.add('sections',2,'A desk can record a booking successfully while its reply gets lost. Repeating the booking because no reply arrived can create a second effect. Keep the original operation ID and ask an authorized, reliable status source what happened. A committed result can be returned; an unresolved outcome needs reconciliation. Cancelling or otherwise offsetting an earlier effect is another action, with its own approval and record.')
