t=a.add('teacher',2, image=a.w['sections'][1]['blocks'][contract]); tr=a.add('teacher',2, image=a.w['sections'][2]['blocks'][trace]); pr=a.add('teacher',2, image=a.w['sections'][6]['blocks'][probes]); sp=a.add('teacher',2, a.w['sections'][5]['blocks'][scope]['text']); tp=a.add('teacher',2, image=a.pic(2)); key=a.add('teacher',2,'Require stable operation identity and reliable authorized status before declaring an outcome. The main booking already exists; returning its result creates no new booking. Prepared is not failed, unknown is not absent, and missing acknowledgement is not proof of rollback. The printer’s reliably absent case may produce a separately approved same-key resend candidate only with required provider controls; it is not an executed resend. Compensation has separate authority and a separate operation identity. The mock trusts supplied access/evidence flags and an exact approval fixture; it does not implement their real verification or a durable recovery protocol. The independent token-transfer scenario remains entirely fictional and should not be repeated blindly.')
