a.finish(routes(('Keep the operation ID. Reconcile the state. Authorize any new effect.','Distinguish committed, prepared, unknown and reliably absent outcomes before retry or compensation decisions.','Status contract → recovery map → printer picture → evidence/authority probes → pure local decision audit → independent unknown-outcome reasoning.'),('Ask what status evidence proves and which separate authority any next action needs.','Use unchanged committed records, conditional same-key resend candidates and separately approved compensation plans without claiming real recovery execution.','Model a lost acknowledgement → inspect status distinctions → compare reliable/unreliable absence → assess fresh unknown-outcome reasoning → preserve reconciliation history.'),('One complete external-effect recovery decision record.','Keep stable identity, status evidence, uncertainty, read permission, resend conditions and separate compensation authority together.','Recall → W1–W3/W5 → independent uncertainty case → project recovery record → delayed return.')))
